┃  Prompting                                                                                                 ┃
┃    enter                 send the prompt                                                                   ┃
┃    shift+enter           newline (also ctrl+j)                                                             ┃
┃    /                     slash-command palette (built-ins always; workspace commands when enabled)         ┃
┃    @                     attach a file: image/audio inlines as media (when supported), else inlines text   ┃
┃    ctrl+v                paste a clipboard image as an attachment (when supported), else paste text        ┃
┃    ctrl+g                select all prompt text                                                            ┃
┃    ctrl+shift+c          copy the active prompt or conversation selection                                  ┃
┃    ctrl+u                clear the unsent prompt                                                           ┃
┃    esc esc (physical)    clear idle draft within 500ms; not remappable; alternative: ClearPrompt / ctrl+u  ┃
┃    esc                   cancel the running turn                                                           ┃
